{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00271","headline":"驾幸三会寺应制 · 上官昭容","name":"驾幸三会寺应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"释子谈经处，轩臣刻字留。\n故台遗老识，残简圣皇求。\n驻跸怀千古，开襟望九州。\n四山缘塞合，二水夹城流。\n宸翰陪瞻仰，天杯接献酬。\n太平词藻盛，长愿纪鸿休。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"上官昭容","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00271.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00271","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}